。\n場面としては死んだと思っていたメイドの「千光寺 雪」が生きており、驚きと混乱で泣いてしまっている状態をお願いしたいです。\n膝をついて子供のように大泣きしてる感じがいいですが、構図はお任せ致します。\n一応資料としては六海と雪の両キャラ添付しますが、メインは六海で雪はお任せします。\nメガネの有無は差分扱いでどっちもあると大変嬉しいですけれど、こちらもお任せします。\nどうかよろしくお願いしますわ～。\n\n六海・L・リトルボーイ（if）(むつみ・るな・りとるぼーい) \nhttps://iachara.com/view/9661187\n千光寺 雪(if)(せんこうじ　ゆき) \nhttps://iachara.com/view/9942972", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 985688, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "すゞ蘭🦔", "screen_name": "su_zura_n713", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1894835323982749701/ZGVn61b1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1353669400654532608/1614782227/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 1787606, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "みそぢる", "screen_name": "misodiru", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1964882803235094528/B21bKv1m.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2609298366/1757299598/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 1978085, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "夏鶏 幸嬉", "screen_name": "Natori_Kouki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1584511816616804353/aGLLla2R.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1436979877777870852/1732399698/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acce